{"unit_id":"xintingcui__dsh-sidebar-panels-fold#card-zh","repo":"xintingcui/dsh-sidebar-panels-fold","commit":"ee55b3e0c7f54cd35a2d765ef4d4e3c1b66c27ae","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels-fold 是一款适用于 DSH Web 客户端的侧边栏面板整理插件。它读取全局面板槽位并在侧边栏行上控制显示状态，把较长的面板列表收纳起来，减少其对工作区空间的占用。用户可以通过新增的管理入口打开面板，选择全部显示、全部收起、恢复默认或逐项勾选。插件会依据窄屏、宽屏和窄轨道采用不同的默认可见数量，并让当前正在使用的面板保持可见。适合希望整理 DSH 侧边栏、同时保留常用面板入口的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部服务，选择保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:404-452","client.js:497-532","client.js:534-660"]}
{"unit_id":"xintingcui__dsh-sidebar-panels-fold#card-en","repo":"xintingcui/dsh-sidebar-panels-fold","commit":"ee55b3e0c7f54cd35a2d765ef4d4e3c1b66c27ae","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels-fold folds DSH Web sidebar panel rows to free workspace space. Its menu shows or hides all panels, restores defaults, or lets users choose entries. Visibility adapts to screen width, and the active panel stays visible. Choices are saved locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:404-452","client.js:497-532","client.js:534-660"]}
