{"unit_id":"xintingcui__dsh-sidebar-panels-fold#feature-4","repo":"xintingcui/dsh-sidebar-panels-fold","commit":"ee55b3e0c7f54cd35a2d765ef4d4e3c1b66c27ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels-fold 的功能「保持当前面板可见」：自动策略或用户选择生效时，当前标记为活动页的面板仍会显示，避免正在使用的面板入口被隐藏。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:368-387"]}
{"unit_id":"xintingcui__dsh-sidebar-panels-fold#caveat-1","repo":"xintingcui/dsh-sidebar-panels-fold","commit":"ee55b3e0c7f54cd35a2d765ef4d4e3c1b66c27ae","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panels-fold 使用前须知：面板显示选择会写入浏览器 localStorage；若存储不可用，选择仅在当前会话生效。（见 client.js:170-195）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:170-195"]}
